{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月18日 10:20 星期三</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>港鐵於今早8時46分指，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。港島線列車服務受阻，整體行車時間一度延長5至8分鐘。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>至早上10時10分，港島線踏入非繁忙時間，港島線往堅尼地城方向列車服務行駛正常班次，往柴灣方向的列車服務的整體行車時間仍須延長3至5分鐘。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕港鐵 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:44:33.015960+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:20:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:38:04.937924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:38:04.937924+00:00","content_hash":"6ce6b1f54a5b4009ad5547bc2efa5e29c55e3bd69fc50b369e19d7f6061db2c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}